#: scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b06df7daf58d2874c6d3a0653d14c89e8375cbdb7694c2daa41a43dc2fcdcc9
#. default-sha256: 2f106b001f49d3fd8181e46ee8faf9b4cb795027a0b2c972aeb59abe0f9cf6f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Master. ⟪k:4⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Maître. ⟪k:4⟫Maître."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: feb102cf85cf10a6c7f3f5270dde1e89bc2c4d8453d0f4454525aa18a67a0d6c
#. default-sha256: 9504d1b2a0195f13605c237990cdf86ed36cb48d217ecf6b9973ef10b78b9629
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you shocked?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or do you instead lament this development?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ê⟪k:2⟫tes-vous choqué ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Déplorez-vous la tournure des événements ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de282974a4b966177b1a84041816c28f080df486d023770607cd704d1237d00d
#. default-sha256: 0638473eaab4516b743dfdbdbd0befede893c69fc240ba7729945ec2a45d9965
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was deeply sorrowful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though to a lesser degree about Maria’s true "
"intentions and more my shameful inability to recognize her machinations."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’étais... ⟪k:1⟫J’étais profondément attristée.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mais moins par les vraies "
"intentions de Maria que par ma scandaleuse incapacité à identifier ses machinations."

#: scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fa34538d6ae2f39961f63078d574e8823b6038970782360fdc9e252ddf8e740
#. default-sha256: e636159b03d4064e4bafb0be783bfa307a2402c19fac7db93316178b7c6be2b1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the time, I too believed that Maria was the White-Haired Girl’s one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ l’époque, moi aussi je croyais que Maria était la seule et unique alliée de la "
"Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd70235ce2f21471c46fe6db969e6b6df97c0916a1e19af03a9d7f285f370d17
#. default-sha256: 270c715e58f36abf53ce9434bc567ee0f85bb5cb09da74cb5a85ca74687b4399
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not until everything had drawn to a close that I discovered the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce n’est que bien après ces événements que je découvris la vérité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9d21a623d048f677b0b2ea5d600995e84a9cd8774a023877b4499089a8f5c20
#. default-sha256: 1349c237c3bd0ce90f4f59901f7ce262889f185a3299e465f8ff288239286e4e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Then I now know how the tale ends, you say? ⟪k:1⟫Yes, that is correct."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Là, je sais comment cela va se finir, vous dites ? ⟪k:1⟫Oui, c’est exact."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16258abcc706b3a6391bfe2ffad8048df037df5cb7edfc41eee7f31e33da8835
#. default-sha256: dec442778b9642f9e0f8813dc05f58189a6af0c956a00bd563f55dfd0cca88e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well aware that it was not the case, I told you the story in a way that suggested she ⟪k:1⟫"
"was⟪k:2⟫ on the White-Haired Girl’s side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tout en étant bien consciente que ce n’était pas le cas, je vous ai raconté l’histoire pour "
"vous faire croire qu’elle ⟪k:1⟫était⟪k:2⟫ du côté de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9163682fe47d4c6fc70b4a80cf438fa72459a1d65e3e4059035cd42465a6fa11
#. default-sha256: f38e36a396299ee56ac6ba4c14997b2f165906d3436aee7782ce476b00eee116
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my... ⟪k:1⟫I wonder if that constitutes lying to you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh ciel... ⟪k:1⟫Je ne sais pas si cela peut être considéré comme un mensonge, Maître."

#: scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81e8baa33446f9920a99acd01709e0f29aada34b193362ee56d6d91b28086386
#. default-sha256: d22abbbf873013afffc0325783d96dbe5285648a10f80f90eac51b58ec8f1948
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I merely wanted to present the events to you in order, starting from the beginning, when "
"Maria’s ill intentions were still veiled in shadow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je voulais simplement vous présenter les événements dans l’ordre, en partant du début, quand "
"les intentions de Maria étaient encore cachées."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 485322ddf1625f525aca285b1eef5789c5eda2b172580f96111219072227999c
#. default-sha256: 670e7e1dd5d19e38ef52b0ed7ede2b10afe67881b7e99e654218b52fbe7e5ebb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted you to know the same feeling of consternation I had experienced."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je voulais que vous éprouviez le même sentiment de consternation que moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91d84395fe25364bacd1b62b2cf0ec971d615781d19ac4daa3304625ebea7a5f
#. default-sha256: 23884f868ec3b5bbc9cc8b95fd70bac25174e78beeda9c6a4249397c2b4f53c5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The White-Haired Girl continued to write letter "
"after letter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs continua à écrire "
"lettre après lettre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b577734b3be9f3ae54d903abbc1f983ceb03d274d32cfa9ff759b0a77cdb306
#. default-sha256: 69fc865f21c6204d8cbc89e7de928dccdf9328c52535977a33e2af69913625ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They were all addressed to her dear husband, detailing her ever-persistent love for him..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elles étaient toutes adressées à son cher mari et racontaient en détail l’amour éternel "
"qu’elle lui vouait..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5394d8d9f8f80fd5bbfed589d652d2b1ea69a8d4bfa06a3e9b0b05ca6ac6e01a
#. default-sha256: 73782744925db1757314946faf6dedb9e045db928b075356d4ab740e639c1a46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and her desire for their relationship to return to what it had once been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...ainsi que son désir de revenir à leur relation d’avant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01ed16b9074533b65571b4c4c9747023c36f2fc628347240f9004eda77e46b9b
#. default-sha256: b716cfd23a4c98f4e0ef73c16a11ff7372da245ace4e1df7ef337ef22be52758
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am sure your hands are quite full right now.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mon bien-aimé,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫je suis sûre que vous êtes trop occupé en ce moment pour me "
"répondre.⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 861e816faaf421460dcfcebde4315733b019c4108df868686c2a326430d29940
#. default-sha256: 1ee169b24ddc3dfb247763d8d6d3e694c85f6c85efb4c45f60e825a5ad9d5b6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But that is fine; it does not change my love for you.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais ce n’est pas grave ; cela ne change en rien mon amour pour vous.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d886f020e70e1b1f85d2cf907197b5100beb7b0faae6100bd90fd28096df18c
#. default-sha256: c679cc65c0c070102d306bc6cdb63a2e983d379e00062dd285cc865f6d55fba1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you remember the day we went out together?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That was, perhaps, the most "
"wonderful day of my life.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I had a truly incredible time.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous souvenez-vous du jour où nous sommes sortis ensemble ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’était peut-être "
"le plus beau jour de ma vie.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫J’ai passé un excellent moment.⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 936318ee3b2c5c266b03e74354be6c536e438c180f17d4e6e4846f8122fa0101
#. default-sha256: 62dd0d0b0fac337a72498f16695cd2910057d4fc0e0f662977c559c0b38ee4a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still treasure the gift you gave to me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫for it is the one and only present I "
"have received from you...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je possède toujours le cadeau que vous m’avez offert, mon seul trésor,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫car "
"c’est le seul présent que j’ai reçu de votre part...⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35a565fb6e2c4469428f7f58f3bda6c62ba25db398fcbf1823f4ec661cda0aa0
#. default-sha256: 293e019590e0cc915c2780787f76246bfa85f0bb215f9c0273b765c4fd033d95
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me, Maria tried to teach me how to dance.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I doubt I will ever "
"progress beyond being laughably bad, though...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cela me rappelle que Maria a essayé de m’apprendre à danser.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mais je doute de "
"pouvoir progresser assez pour ne plus être ridicule...⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9d26442315f4937580f451966aa6375726c7be347f85623ed4f36ed23a09363
#. default-sha256: 189a63b0835ec5652f475e035a90f144726142dc91ebb54d42c402e44781556a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It would be nice if, someday, you and I could dance together.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce serait bien si, un jour, vous et moi pouvions danser ensemble.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02ae74d31c7acedfbeb51ecf04afd4376ac9b387a010d83af4206cf2f2e9f9db
#. default-sha256: 4ffdc13b986aa27a15c4d2082b14b86646565a898fa59bcbfbf8b8fdb7cccade
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps, when you have a little respite from work, we could go out again, maybe take a "
"carriage somewhere a little farther away.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Peut-être que, quand vous aurez un peu de répit au travail, nous pourrions sortir à "
"nouveau, éventuellement pousser la voiture un peu plus loin.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d23e94706b7752337a1b1391cee258d02806a6d52cac420207cf80d63e6af22
#. default-sha256: b83ea8a284e913a71273a1e8edb78d8fe125a4b6eb6a2da07e51b62e33e7442a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And we could dine at a restaurant more to your liking.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Et on pourrait dîner à un restaurant qui serait davantage à votre goût.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dbf48d9da182b2004d2a3a707b22e54656e2a0d62bd9df3a6f60a7e1f68a7ee
#. default-sha256: d3248ce3b2635dc4c310394319a6e253104641ab960f33443e5a337a3c4123dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Although, I think the cuisine at the other restaurant was exquisite, personally.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais je dois dire que j’ai trouvé que la cuisine de l’autre restaurant était exquise, "
"personnellement.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae0dfaab7e83035c27a6f4152cc6cce4d1f13243e58526314059365fd91a0def
#. default-sha256: 477cc609d9fe7f0b26ef6b72341b8d3bd85d550311f5bb3b8848c9e69066238f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do I, perhaps, have an unrefined palate?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je n’ai peut-être pas un palais très raffiné ?⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6f7dbfc2987c0984a8f1f7d22259d5c309577fe3671f81ef9333ef828736ff2
#. default-sha256: cec0ccd209ad626c19b1445113994f335e67cc919ac33dca1a1d275b9b54c8e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria altered the letters before delivering them, however.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She changed the "
"addressee from Jacopo to another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, Maria modifiait les lettres avant de les livrer.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle changeait le "
"destinataire qui n’était plus Jacopo mais un autre homme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ce36e55d584bb5c5da87adfed95a18da95ce539641aa95a9c0ea3dd2bc9defa
#. default-sha256: e8bb439519813e363cec44ac12acc7f70a6a52c94f219c493b422d9929b94434
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would cut away the top of the page with Jacopo’s name on it, and in the space below "
"write a different name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle découpait le haut de la feuille où était inscrit le nom de Jacopo et dans l’espace en "
"dessous, elle écrivait un nom différent."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee15b1c00d2b2e0876773cd93d87315eebabbb6352e14d37e4ababbcc172f1d8
#. default-sha256: 6e473aca89062d67af141c0e7b831a6091d89119a4ea0e8750ef4ddd26fb205f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could not have mimicked the White-Haired Girl’s handwriting for the full length of a "
"letter, but Maria could make a single name look adequately similar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria n’aurait pas pu imiter l’écriture de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs sur toute la longueur "
"de la lettre, mais elle pouvait s’en sortir avec un seul mot."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101EB0A4_AF89_43CD_B7F7_037D32EFC20E
