"⟪k:0⟫The more she inscribed of her feelings for Jacopo, the greater the turmoil grew within his "
"heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Plus elle avouait ses sentiments pour Jacopo, plus son cœur s’embrasait de jalousie."

