msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And both the White-Haired Girl and Jacopo continued to place their "
"confidence in Maria—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫the one responsible for everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Et ils continuèrent tous deux à placer leur confiance en Maria—⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫ la seule responsable de toute cette situation."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 592bd6d95e04acaa0adf5852c265fe06ba796bfb263664f5306749cd34347b99
