msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Mais vous n’aurez jamais de réponse..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D2BA10E_EF7F_4518_A2BF_1E9D90D2C4FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4efe977d6e1fe5b15950668a89aba3af1ff8826fec65ebd8a48dfe75435b7b8a
