#: scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0053d1abc877d0aceb998da1ea3b0469add8f3d88ba66d95877f80a97a63ebd
