msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had he simply stepped up and taken action,⟪k:1⟫he could have put an end to the stream of "
"letters,⟪k:2⟫each of which gave rise to further misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si seulement il s’était secoué, s’il avait pris les choses en main,⟪k:1⟫il aurait pu mettre "
"fin à la kyrielle de lettres qui s’accumulaient peu à peu pour augmenter le quiproquo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dbb218a252b9f1efe59804d3339e525968874bcb0ea7ae181aeb246bb8e9bf0
#. default-sha256: d06e95cd9c49a8e2dd82dd570e16e18d75273c8eb676e6a5c61911a04eecfd1d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He needed merely ask the White-Haired Girl in-person to whom the letters were addressed, "
"whether what they described were true, and the twisted threads of his confusion would have all "
"been unraveled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’avait qu’à simplement demander à la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs à qui les lettres étaient "
"adressées, si ce qu’elles racontaient était vrai, et les fils emmêlés de ce malentendu se "
"seraient tous dénoués."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c7f93b71fde6af532a8136f6cc028e9a935fdc991dde66cb57162f9cef08b5d
#. default-sha256: 1b1d9661b49edbf33fed2f6232018885134b981aa72bc3bd40d8dc4a772e05b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he made no such effort, relying instead on Maria to serve as his intermediary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il ne fit rien de tel. Non, à la place, il comptait sur Maria pour servir "
"d’intermédiaire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70ae674aff66cd0556fcc8c36357db68234ffa7e789bb44df75f58cbbeb76d51
