msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he had a great deal of pride in his capabilities,⟪k:1⟫he had far less confidence in "
"himself as a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait beau être très fier de ses capacités,⟪k:1⟫il avait beaucoup moins confiance en lui "
"en tant que personne."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9c5d538e74f7389dc67c3fc40429a204c5f6c2b84478e3439e9abcc83ace99c
#. default-sha256: 4cc07e9209d9448b53ad1c953fbdffb0af301e7fc685889a251a922f3748eb1a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If he’d had faith in himself, perhaps he could have put faith in his wife as well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫S’il avait cru en lui, peut-être aurait-il pu faire confiance à sa femme également."

#: scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e2340b858e547e11831c46a75743d8a4caf3deab3fd0186311882a866495815
#. default-sha256: 516a8b1cca9988495b906aa4019395d44f6e809e3ea8a3f71969eebfadbe988f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had his pride not been so twisted, perhaps he would not have been so afraid of being hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si sa fierté n’avait pas été aussi enracinée, il n’aurait peut-être pas eu peur d’être "
"blessé à ce point."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f468d64186e6a7507274f17c013772ff32f8ab5a6f16ce89157842d9bebff21
#. default-sha256: ce52c8bd311105dbb92226925ebe90d6949a3ef1baef7aec39b97f5d1adb21f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Indeed, he was afraid. ⟪k:1⟫Afraid of being rejected by her. ⟪k:2⟫Afraid to face a reality "
"where his beloved partner scorned him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et pourtant, il avait peur. ⟪k:1⟫Peur d’être rejeté par elle. ⟪k:2⟫Peur d’affronter une "
"réalité où sa partenaire bien-aimée le mépriserait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd16f07b21f3d3430a02f2a4609c8df68357fb72cbda847dccceb3da5f2173cd
#. default-sha256: 5f2bd1553b70395f8a5befe2cdab380d5547000d997a9c2c05349bd9af67e346
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where the woman he loved laughed at him disdainfully. ⟪k:1⟫Where she and countless others "
"mocked him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Où la femme qu’il aimait lui rirait au nez avec dédain. ⟪k:1⟫Où elle se joindrait à d’autres "
"pour se moquer de lui."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6eb0b3eeb75da284bfe0334c8b29978dd657390cc1c15b25896ad83871de8483
