msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The environment in which he had been raised played a significant part in his state of mind, "
"I expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’environnement dans lequel il avait grandi jouait un rôle important dans son état d’esprit, "
"je pense."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f229ea9f955b74177328b920e6d6ab46ab5f51c336f97f3cb9ebca764e8b5b5a
#. default-sha256: 7edb49aa66e1167536881762fb442a31f8684a7ec756cb6fd248ecd49ca89ff1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Occasionally, the name on the letter would change.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria was making the White-"
"Haired Girl out to be having affairs with multiple other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Parfois, le nom sur la lettre changeait.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria faisait passer la Fille aux Cheveux "
"Blancs pour une femme qui avait des liaisons avec beaucoup d’autres hommes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A45E1A2B_7E31_4F08_A830_BA8B1F55B6A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f261bb7ce918e6d6a0b54690d9e9864d45e80166d60df01e4f42e78906db3f5f
