msgid "⟪k:0⟫She could never do any such thing, of course."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle n’aurait jamais pu faire une chose pareille, bien entendu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CF09187E_FDCF_423D_8B2C_E7DC2200258D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b403927de385eea573ffb17c8f119b884e4679bc08de18d3a2c99719139f5ae7
