msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There’s a limit to what we can accomplish on this tiny island."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nous sommes limités dans nos actions, sur cette île minuscule."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDBF994F_ED58_4460_9E56_8E6B499A8686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 922f86f15aa5c231b8d9394c4d9c26241df029894bec2c60409e9077f0fa225a
