msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the previous capofamiglia was an incredibly reticent man.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It took all he had to "
"merely preserve his small chunk of the world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...le précédent parrain était un homme incroyablement réservé.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il a mis toutes ses "
"forces à simplement préserver son petit bout de terre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BC07195_7C3E_449C_915B_F852039EB9AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 729677ed5ce9ff703e0d8b7a82874d63dfac475fb5bb3b561131329523596f14
