msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would be madness ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ to hurry, given the circumstances.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You should be "
"well aware of that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce serait de la folie que de ⟪k:1⟫ne pas⟪k:2⟫ se dépêcher, vu les circonstances.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tu "
"dois en être bien conscient."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C89FD3BD_16F4_480C_B61C_4C3EDAFE79EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab2b34fd2b6112a623935d351bf323e9b2ff239d6483b1b8d5080149c32a866f
