msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_826F0D3F_4803_453B_ACD8_C19823B199D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If the woman isn’t to your liking,⟪k:1⟫you can find another one that is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She’s only "
"going to be your wife in name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si la femme ne te plaît pas,⟪k:1⟫tu peux en trouver une autre.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Elle ne sera que ton "
"épouse par le nom."

#: scenario3:scenario3_725E7DF5_A653_4B90_AD65_C2F703EF57FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21b315e3b0dc710284b5bb2b4310066f515ba87ee4e1118c2352c23d8710ccf4
#. default-sha256: f13ec36f451d84ae648dc2ed2a273e2a96bb87a047e7c6562b4926ad96c661d3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_725E7DF5_A653_4B90_AD65_C2F703EF57FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But listen to me, son.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫must not⟪k:4⟫ allow her to fool around."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais écoute-moi bien, fils.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu ne ⟪k:3⟫dois pas⟪k:4⟫ la laisser te ridiculiser."

#: scenario3:scenario3_380FA7EE_6339_494D_91E6_60725FCAB712
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edb2aff6d155bded38dd6a765e1253a13382f4edf4fb2e82368c40bb9947baee
#. default-sha256: 0a3d3aaf6fbe655ecea717637c6de4327adcffb74252b1446ed3d5a5b5417fd1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_380FA7EE_6339_494D_91E6_60725FCAB712"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What are the most vital things to have in our society?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Money? Power? Yes, those are "
"important.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫But what matters most is ⟪k:5⟫respect⟪k:6⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qu’est-ce qu’il y a de plus vital dans une société ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’argent ? Le pouvoir ? C’est "
"sûr, c’est important.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mais ce qui compte le plus, c’est le ⟪k:5⟫respect⟪k:6⟫."

#: scenario3:scenario3_51596965_202A_4B4E_98EB_085DD0918BCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16a285bf958ab1380fe2210acc59eff1f33a12846bcc529f38eef8f3a8bdf6f7
#. default-sha256: d659de20e0157a263d38ffe1b5e076f5fe298af89694872e01826f957b756f46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_51596965_202A_4B4E_98EB_085DD0918BCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No one’s going to follow a capofamiglia they can’t respect.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They’ll try to "
"undermine your authority."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Personne ne suivra un capofamiglia qui ne se fait pas respecter.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ils essayeront de "
"saper ton autorité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_65FD62C1_0EB4_4358_ACF1_F8CB381AE42E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f98d034536af91c993551a9ffb263dfb7cd28eac3da84f48abe08ad218227214
#. default-sha256: 3083666da08afa1da8f55bd4737633b1139e41d602da4609fa965911d05b160a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_65FD62C1_0EB4_4358_ACF1_F8CB381AE42E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once someone deems you weaker than them, courtesy goes out the window, and that’s a judgment "
"that’s near impossible to overturn."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une fois que quelqu’un t’estime plus faible que lui, finies les courbettes, tu pourras bien "
"faire tout ce que tu voudras, ça ne changera plus jamais."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5A49B03_97E2_40C5_80D8_27F220FDCD23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 775474cc1d9556d4fab95c90d06a5e3d8644fe0498ebf9fd19027b30140199d0
