msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...ta fiancée t’est un jour infidèle..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3B25E1C1_7DE2_445E_BC27_259AC8A142A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
